  "id": "symbol",
  "term": "symbol",
  "definition": "A symbol is a cue, such as an icon, that carries socially shared or culturally meaningful significance rather than functioning only as a neutral object. In this context, symbols can evoke responses linked to the meaning people attach to them.",
